  "readmeFile": "readme.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds AdConfig.UserId for rewarded server-to-server callbacks (%user% via /ri), AdPlayEventArgs.MSFTNotify and AdPlayEventArgs.CallToActionClicked, and token-based diagnostic listeners (AddDiagnosticListenerWithToken / RemoveDiagnosticListenerByToken). The /config response parser now reads both the v5 and v7 shapes. BREAKING: AdConfig and AdPlayEventArgs gained members and are passed by value across the DLL boundary, so consumers must recompile against the 7.1.0 headers. DEPRECATED: LiftoffAdPlayInfo::CampaignId -- use CreativeId; the campaign id goes permanently empty at SDK 7.4.0.",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
  "title": "Vungle SDK for Windows Desktop Native C++ (x64)",
  "verbatimVersion": "7.1.0",
